'''Blighted super restore''' potions are a variant of [[super restore]] potion that can only be drunk while inside the [[Wilderness]], [[Ferox Enclave]], [[Mage Arena bank]], [[PvP world]]s, [[Castle Wars]], and [[Clan Wars]]. If a [[Prayer cape]] or [[ring of the gods (i)]] is equipped, or if a Prayer cape or [[holy wrench]] is in the player's inventory, the Prayer restore increases to 8 + 27% of the player's current Prayer level, rounded down. This does not affect the rate of restoration of stats other than Prayer.

4 can be purchased at [[Justine's stuff for the Last Shopper Standing]] for 1 [[Last Man Standing]] point or at the [[Soul Wars Reward Shop]] for 10 [[Zeal Tokens]]. Unlike other potions, only the 4-dose variant is purchasable on the [[Grand Exchange]].

Attempting to drink the potion outside the Wilderness prints the message {{mes|The blighted potion can be used only in the Wilderness.}} However, the potion will act like a regular super restore potion in PvP worlds, which can be useful for Ironman accounts with limited access to prayer-restoring potions.

